{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6a00291d-4287-8ccc-8950-6cbcbada1c69",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T12:07:57-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:05:22-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:05:27-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Hello. [pause] Is this... the school department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:05:31-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, ma'am, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. Who were you trying to reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:05:37-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The school. The school department. [pause] I wanted to ask about... signing up. For my grandson. Oh dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:05:44-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's all right. The school department is a separate office from us. We don't handle enrollment here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:05:51-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Separate. [pause] I see. I thought... I thought it was all the same. The city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:05:57-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A lot of people do. The schools run their own office. I can help you find the right number to dial."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:05-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that would be... [pause] kind. I am so sorry. I dialed the wrong one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:11-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize at all. Do you have a pen handy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:16-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait. [pause] No, no, honey, that is not for you. [pause] Sorry. The little one. He wants the phone. He is grabbing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:25-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Sounds like you've got your hands full. Is this for a child who's starting kindergarten, or switching schools?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:33-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. No, I am not the... [pause] I am calling for my mother. She is ninety-some. She wants to know about her great-grandson. Where he goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:43-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's about registering him, or finding out which school he'd be assigned to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:49-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Which school. Yes. That one. [pause] I think. Is that different from signing up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:06:55-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's related. The school department can tell you both. They'll ask for his address and birth date, so have those ready when you call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:04-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Address. Birth date. [pause] Let me write that. Oh, he has the pen now. Hold on. [pause] Sorry. Sorry, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:12-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. I'll wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:15-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I have a... paper. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:18-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Best thing is to call the school department's main office. If you look on the city website, it lists them under schools, or you can ask the operator at City Hall to connect you. Want me to transfer you right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:33-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can do that? [pause] Oh, yes. Please. I would not know... where to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:39-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Stay on the line, it may ring a few times. If it drops, call us back and I'll help again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:48-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] And I am sorry again. For the bother."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:07:53-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's no bother. Here you go, ma'am. Hold on."
    }
  ],
